{"Title":"An Act relative to community college tuition for graduates of Brockton public schools","BillNumber":"H3867","DocketNumber":"HD4054","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"RAM1","Name":"Rita A. Mendes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RAM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:39:36.02"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"RAM1","Name":"Rita A. Mendes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RAM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:39:36.02"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-07T21:17:02.3833333"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-21T16:49:54.17"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3867/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Mendes of Brockton, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3867) of Rita A. Mendes, Michelle M. DuBois and Samantha Montaño relative to community college tuition for graduates of Brockton public schools.  Higher Education.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 15A of the General Laws is hereby amended by adding the following section:-\r\n\tSection 48. Each student who has graduated from a high school within the Brockton public school district shall be entitled, upon enrollment in at least 1 class at Massasoit Community College, to a full waiver for charges due for tuition and mandatory fees during the period of enrollment.\r\n\tConsistent with the provisions of this section, the board may establish general guidelines and regulations for the application and administration of waiver benefits at Massasoit Community College.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}